      "id": "claim_0eceff661b5c403ab51f3fdc1dbbd39a",
      "statement": "Deep Agents follows a trust-the-LLM model, so containment belongs in installed tool implementations, backends, or sandboxes; HITL is opt-in, StateBackend does not execute shell commands, and LocalShellBackend is an explicit higher-power opt-in.",
